{"unit_id":"peterwangze__software-project-governance#feature-1","repo":"peterwangze/software-project-governance","commit":"2db5ece500990d4dd176dd2200dae94b4aedbb11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Software Project Governance 的功能「项目初始化」：为新项目或进行中的项目收集阶段、目标和治理强度等参数，并创建治理记录。通过初始化流程触发，产出项目治理目录和后续工作入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["commands/governance-init.md:1-35"]}
{"unit_id":"peterwangze__software-project-governance#feature-2","repo":"peterwangze/software-project-governance","commit":"2db5ece500990d4dd176dd2200dae94b4aedbb11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Software Project Governance 的功能「协调任务」：Coordinator 将目标拆成带输入、输出、验收标准和证据要求的子任务，再按任务类型路由给相应角色。由治理工作流自动触发，形成分工清晰的执行安排。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/software-project-governance/SKILL.md:26-40"]}
{"unit_id":"peterwangze__software-project-governance#feature-3","repo":"peterwangze/software-project-governance","commit":"2db5ece500990d4dd176dd2200dae94b4aedbb11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Software Project Governance 的功能「独立审查」：运行 /governance-review 可选择需求、设计、代码、测试、发布或复盘审查。工作流派发 Reviewer，并将结论和待修问题写入治理记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["commands/governance-review.md:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"peterwangze__software-project-governance#feature-4","repo":"peterwangze/software-project-governance","commit":"2db5ece500990d4dd176dd2200dae94b4aedbb11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Software Project Governance 的功能「状态与门禁跟踪」：治理工作流维护阶段状态、任务证据和 Gate 结果，并在推进前要求补齐相应检查。由会话入口和阶段转换触发，帮助查看当前进展与未完成事项。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/software-project-governance/SKILL.md:61-67","skills/software-project-governance/SKILL.md:32-40"]}
{"unit_id":"peterwangze__software-project-governance#caveat-1","repo":"peterwangze/software-project-governance","commit":"2db5ece500990d4dd176dd2200dae94b4aedbb11","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Software Project Governance 使用前须知：原生预设注册依赖宿主提供 agent-preset registry；缺少该能力时入口只告警并跳过，目录型宿主需显式运行适配器安装路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:654-665","lib/index.js:691-713"]}
